sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant API as Backend API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant S as MinIO staging
  participant R as RabbitMQ
  participant F as MinIO final
  participant N as Notification channel
  U->>API: POST /documents (multipart file)
  API->>S: Store staging/{documentId}
  API->>DB: Persist PENDING
  API->>R: Publish document request with confirm
  API-->>U: 201 Created
  R->>API: Consume request
  API->>DB: Claim PROCESSING
  API->>S: Read staging object
  API->>F: Store final object
  API->>DB: Persist COMPLETED or FAILED
  API->>N: Publish lifecycle event
  N-->>U: WebSocket event
